WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.990
It was Mom and Dad's wedding anniversary.

2
00:00:06.991 --> 00:00:10.914
The kids and Aunt Judy were making dinner.

3
00:00:10.915 --> 00:00:16.551
"It will be very special!" Oliver said.

4
00:00:16.552 --> 00:00:21.321
"Let's make pasta," Emmy said.

5
00:00:21.322 --> 00:00:25.592
"And sauce with vegetables," Aunt Judy said.

6
00:00:25.593 --> 00:00:29.469
"And cake!" Harry said.

7
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:34.238
"And toast," Oliver said.

8
00:00:34.239 --> 00:00:38.302
"Toast isn't special," Harry said.

9
00:00:38.303 --> 00:00:40.490
Oliver shrugged.

10
00:00:40.491 --> 00:00:44.393
"I'm good at making toast."

11
00:00:44.394 --> 00:00:48.999
Emmy boiled pasta.

12
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.269
Harry and Aunt Judy chopped vegetables.

13
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:58.028
Oliver made toast.

14
00:00:58.029 --> 00:01:01.859
Emmy tasted the sauce.

15
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:05.866
"It needs a little salt," she thought.

16
00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:09.473
She put some in.

17
00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:14.954
Harry and Emmy mixed the cake batter.

18
00:01:14.955 --> 00:01:19.010
Harry put the pan in the oven.

19
00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:23.390
Aunt Judy put the vegetables in the sauce.

20
00:01:23.391 --> 00:01:30.311
"It needs a little salt," she thought.

21
00:01:30.312 --> 00:01:33.963
Harry mixed the pasta and sauce together.

22
00:01:33.964 --> 00:01:41.085
"It needs a little salt," he thought.

23
00:01:41.086 --> 00:01:45.252
Mom and Dad sat at the table.

24
00:01:45.253 --> 00:01:52.255
"How's the food?" Emmy asked.

25
00:01:52.256 --> 00:01:55.229
"Good," Dad said.

26
00:01:55.230 --> 00:02:02.417
"But it's a little—"

27
00:02:02.418 --> 00:02:06.373
"Salty!" Mom said.

28
00:02:06.374 --> 00:02:10.430
"I only added a little salt!" Emmy said.

29
00:02:10.431 --> 00:02:13.931
"Me too!" Harry said.

30
00:02:13.932 --> 00:02:19.302
"Uh-oh!" Aunt Judy said.

31
00:02:19.303 --> 00:02:23.571
"We still have dessert," Emmy said.

32
00:02:23.572 --> 00:02:26.243
"Ack!" Harry cried.

33
00:02:26.244 --> 00:02:33.110
"I forgot about the cake!"

34
00:02:33.111 --> 00:02:38.066
The cake was black.

35
00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:41.604
Harry groaned.

36
00:02:41.605 --> 00:02:46.831
"We ruined the anniversary dinner!"

37
00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:52.294
"I made lots of toast!" Oliver said.

38
00:02:52.295 --> 00:02:54.932
Dad smiled.

39
00:02:54.933 --> 00:02:57.927
"We love toast!"

40
00:02:57.928 --> 00:03:08.659
"And each other," Mom said.

